NOTICE: this program runs popsicle circuit PSI (psi) or the swanky-oprf-kmprt OPPRF (kmprt) from Swanky, which its README calls research software,
not for production or sensitive data. The two parties are threads of this one process,
joined by an in-process socket pair. Data: synthetic keys made by this program; nothing is read
from or written to disk, and results print to this terminal only. Limits: one case per run; a watchdog ends the process after 60 s, and until then a case that does not complete keeps one CPU core busy.
It reproduces upstream behaviour at a pinned commit and establishes no security property.
It creates no persistent state.
